
**Regions and Avaialbility Zone
--> A region is a seperate geographical area where AWS has its data centers.
eg: ap-south-1, us-east-1 etc
--> An Avaialbility zone is an isolated location within an AWS region, consisting of one or more data centers.
--> A region contains multiple AZ.


